Note: the bot PAT (nmime) lacks the `workflow` scope, so it cannot push
changes to .github/workflows/** (GitHub rejects such pushes for PATs without
the scope; Contents API and App-creation-via-API were also verified blocked).
Any token with workflow scope can apply this in one command:
